<p>Not gonna lie, I'm digging this idea! A Foundation clone. Or the original foundation that the Foundation was cloned from. who knows? This article is going to be like a dog chasing its tail. Or a tail chasing a dog. It's sure to be a fascinating, mildly infuriating, but nonetheless fun article to see!<br />
You seem to have a solid narrative. Wouldn't it be funny if at the same time SCP was infiltrating the PCS, the PCS was infiltrating the SCP? I kind of like Cybersqyd's idea of having the PCS be an extension of the SCP Foundation and the MTF just raids their own base. Since the two organizations are backronyms of each other, I doubt that such an occurrence could be chalked up to chance. Maybe have some sort of implications or hypotheses to throughout the story? Like the PCS is from an alternate dimension, or both groups are old rivals, or that they're the same organization. Something like that to bring the reader full circle.<br />
